category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 31-38
zone The Barrens
keywords In Search of Menara Voidrender, Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe, Fine Gold Thread, The Completed Robe, Menara Voidrender, Xizk Goodstitch, Robes of Arcana, Gold Bar, Vial of Hatefury Blood, Lesser Infernal Stone, Smoldering Coal, Burning Exile, Sargeron, Mannoroc Coven, Circle of West Binding, Warlock, class armor
