why A rare cloth robe for your 30s from Menara Voidrender; its last parts wait for levels 35 and 37.

# The Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe: In Search of Menara Voidrender (4736 Briarthorn,
# Ironforge; 4737 Zevrost, Orgrimmar; 4738 Demisette Cloyce, Stormwind; 4739
# Kaal Soulreaper, Undercity; they exclude each other) to Menara in Ratchet,
# then Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe: 1796 (Robes of Arcana),
# 4781 (a Gold Bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay), 4782 (back to Menara),
# 4783 (10 Vials of Hatefury Blood and a Lesser Infernal Stone, Desolace),
# 4784 (Fine Gold Thread from Xizk's free quest 4785, 2 Smoldering Coals from
# the Arathi Burning Exiles, a Soul Shard), and The Completed Robe (4786).
# Drops (items.json): Hatefury satyrs (31-32) 40%, so about 25 kills for ten
# vials; Lesser Infernals (36-37) and Demon Portal Guardians (38) 50%; Burning
# Exiles (38-39) 30%. None is elite.
# Level holds (#1667: an Orc Warlock at 31 was sent to the Burning Exiles and
# couldn't solo them): the chain opens at 31, but a step waits until its mobs'
# top level is at most 2 above you: the Lesser Infernal Stone at 35, the
# Smoldering Coal at 37 (the quest itself is level 37). The vials (31-32) don't
# wait, so the Desolace satyrs are their own step.
# Robes of Arcana and the Gold Bar have no place to fetch them: tailors make
# the robe (the pattern is a rare drop; the quest notes name the Dark Strand
# Voidcallers at the Tower of Althalaxx), miners smelt the bar (it also turns
# up in world chests); everyone else buys them at the Auction House: the
# goals point at the auctioneers of Stormwind and Orgrimmar.
# The Completed Robe's objective is listed as a kill of Menara in the data; it
# is a short wait beside her (quest notes, Classic quest text): do not attack.
# ASSUMED: The chain runs as in Classic above 30 (Classic flow; Forever's data has no play reports past the level-30 beta cap). In-game check: Xizk's thread hand-out and Menara's wait.
# Sources: Forever's quest data (quests.json, npcs.json, items.json,
# professions) for the givers, the drops and the crafts; the quest notes
# (data/local/mechanics) for the camps, the coal trick and the wait.

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 31 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip.
  level 31
  accept 4738                         -- Demisette Cloyce

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 31 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip.
  level 31
  accept 4736                         -- Briarthorn

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 31 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip.
  level 31
  accept 4737                         -- Zevrost

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 31 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet; the zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip.
  level 31
  accept 4739                         -- Kaal Soulreaper

step Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar
  tip Tailors sew the Robes of Arcana from a rare pattern; miners smelt Gold Bars from Gold Ore. Everyone else buys both at the Auction House. If you wear the robe, take it off: Menara keeps it.
  collect 5770 @61.2,71.3 map 1453 live only Alliance -- Robes of Arcana: the Auction House
  collect 5770 @55.9,62.7 map 1454 only Horde -- Robes of Arcana: the Auction House
  collect 3577 @61.2,71.3 map 1453 live only Alliance -- Gold Bar: the Auction House
  collect 3577 @55.9,62.7 map 1454 only Horde -- Gold Bar: the Auction House

step Menara Voidrender
  zone The Barrens
  tip Menara Voidrender stands by Strahad Farsan's tower on the hill above Ratchet, behind the engineers' hut. She takes the robe, then sends the gold bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay.
  turnin 4738 only Human              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4736 only Gnome              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4737 only Orc,Troll          -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4739 only Undead             -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 1796
  turnin 1796                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4781

step Xizk Goodstitch
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The boat from Ratchet sails to Booty Bay. Xizk Goodstitch runs A Tailor to Cities on an upper level of the town. Give him the Gold Bar; he will spin the thread later.
  turnin 4781                         -- Xizk Goodstitch
  accept 4782

step Back to Menara
  zone The Barrens
  tip You need no thread yet: Menara wants demon parts from Desolace next.
  turnin 4782                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4783

step Hatefury satyrs
  zone Desolace
  tip The Hatefury satyrs (level 31-32) hold Sargeron in the far north-east of Desolace, past Nijel's Point: two kills in five give a vial, so plan on about 25.
  collect 6989 x10 quest 4783.1       -- Vials of Hatefury Blood

step Mannoroc Coven
  zone Desolace
  tip The Lesser Infernals (36-37) and Demon Portal Guardians (38) of Mannoroc Coven, in the south of Desolace, drop the stone half the time. The guide waits for level 35 first: at 31 they are too strong to solo. They resist fire, so use Shadow Bolt and Corruption.
  level 35
  collect 6990 quest 4783.2           -- Lesser Infernal Stone

step Menara again
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 4783                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4784

step Fine Gold Thread
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Back to Xizk in Booty Bay: he offers Fine Gold Thread as a quest you hand straight back to him. He may show no quest marker; talk to him anyway.
  turnin 4785 direct                  -- Xizk Goodstitch: Fine Gold Thread, handed straight back
  collect 12293 quest 4784.1          -- Fine Gold Thread

step Smoldering Coal
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Burning Exiles (level 38-39), fire elementals at the Circle of West Binding in western Arathi Highlands, drop the coal about one time in three. The guide waits for level 37 first: below it they hit too hard to solo. They resist fire: Shadow Bolt and Corruption. The Cresting Charms from the Cresting Exiles near Hammerfall finish one off once you have hurt it. Make a Soul Shard with Drain Soul on the way.
  level 37
  collect 6991 x2 quest 4784.2        -- Smoldering Coal
  collect 6265 quest 4784.3 @24.9,30.5 -- Soul Shard: Drain Soul on an Exile as it dies

step The Completed Robe
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara with the thread, the coals and a Soul Shard. Then wait beside her while she works the robe (do not attack her: the quest log calls it a kill), and speak to her again.
  turnin 4784                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4786
  complete 4786 @62.5,35.4            -- Wait beside Menara while she finishes the robe
  turnin 4786                         -- Menara Voidrender: Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe
